---
/**
 * The wrapper the site's layout gives a page that does not lay out its own
 * full-bleed sections (#160).
 *
 * The site's layout puts every page inside
 * `<div class="container mb-4">` unless it declares `content_for :fullwidth`.
 * The pages that do -- the home page, the five services whitepapers -- draw
 * their own sections edge to edge and must not be boxed; the rest are an
 * article on white and would run into the viewport without this.
 */
---
<div class="site-container pb-8">
  <slot />
</div>
